{"nodes": [{"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_frompart10stream", "label": "fromPart10Stream (chunked streaming source, slice K)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decision D-C: a self-contained ported body loop (await-at-boundaries) rather than adapting the tokenizer, which assumes one contiguous buffer. Decision D-E: noCopy intentionally rejected because zero-copy views alias chunk memory that consume() releases mid-parse. Bounded memory (~336 KB peak for encapsulated) via clearBuffers + per-element/per-fragment consume(); promise-driven backpressure via setDrain/awaitDrain."}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_asyncdicomreader", "label": "AsyncDicomReader (legacy chunk-feed reader)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Still runs its own header/element loop with the 4-verb DicomMetadataListener vocabulary and delegates the meta group to the eager DicomMessage._read \u2014 the main reason the eager read loop survives in the 1.0 beta. Kept self-contained deliberately; still the right tool for per-frame pixel-data delivery."}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_eventstreamlistener", "label": "EventStreamListener (15-verb vocabulary)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_dicommetadatalistener", "label": "DicomMetadataListener (4-verb legacy vocabulary)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_splitdataview", "label": "SplitDataView (chunk-spanning DataView facade)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "1.0 scoped fix: findStart caches the last chunk hit (and checks its successor) before falling back to linear scan, making sequential streaming reads O(1) per primitive instead of O(chunks)."}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_delta_a", "label": "DELTA-A (encapsulated startElement.length divergence)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "fromPart10Stream carries the on-wire 0xFFFFFFFF for encapsulated pixel data while the buffered path carries a computed span; normalized by name in the gate suite and pinned in code."}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_delta_b", "label": "DELTA-B (undefined-length text VR loud failure)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deliberate divergence for non-conformant undefined-length UT/UC/UR: the stream fails noisily (truncation throw) where the buffered path silently consumes trailing bytes into a garbage string and loses elements. Loud failure over silent mishandling; pinned by K4 Test 22b."}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_k7_replatform", "label": "K7 AsyncDicomReader Re-platform Assessment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deferred to 1.x because two breakage points prevent a thin adapter: uncompressed pixel-data frame splitting (fromPart10Stream delivers one flat binary sub-stream; AsyncDicomReader splits per-frame from tracked geometry) and compressed frame assembly from Basic Offset Table offsets. Options: per-frame events, a frame-assembly adapter, or a comprehensive shim."}, {"id": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_readbufferstream", "label": "ReadBufferStream (windowed / chunked byte stream)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_frompart10stream", "target": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_event_stream_decodecore", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_frompart10stream", "target": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_eventstreamlistener", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_frompart10stream", "target": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_readbufferstream", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "packages_docs_docs_architecture_streaming_frompart10stream", "target": "packages_docs_docs_guides_deflate_pako", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "packages/docs/docs/architecture/streaming.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, 